<%--
Sie_Child - slot-only template. Its class extends Sie_Bad_Parent, so the framework
resolves Sie_Bad_Parent's template through the JS prototype chain and invokes it with
these slots. That parent template throws.
--%>
<Define:Sie_Child>
  <Slot:body>
    <span>child slot content</span>
  </Slot:body>
</Define:Sie_Child>
